      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "This property may be `nil` indicating that the underlying media presented when the option is selected carries no language information.",
      "normalizedSource": "This property may be `nil` indicating that the underlying media presented when the option is selected carries no language information.",
      "sourceHash": "188f5e221c82f33e6ec615f9b06de41e29a642f124d05de6ea4f3db60a7bf73c",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "This can occur with media formats for which language information is optional, such as HTTP Live Streaming playlists, or that do not accommodate language information in machine-readable form.",
      "documentTitle": "extendedLanguageTag",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "이 속성은 `nil`일 수 있으며, 이는 옵션이 선택될 때 표시되는 기본 미디어가 언어 정보를 포함하지 않음을 의미합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:29.138Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "This can occur with media formats for which language information is optional, such as HTTP Live Streaming playlists, or that do not accommodate language information in machine-readable form.",
      "normalizedSource": "This can occur with media formats for which language information is optional, such as HTTP Live Streaming playlists, or that do not accommodate language information in machine-readable form.",
      "sourceHash": "9448a0977768e554c9c6dce61b356de1d888963bbfc2255dc0963addce6928ea",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "This property may be `nil` indicating that the underlying media presented when the option is selected carries no language information.",
      "contextAfter": "Clients that are filtering media selection options by language should be prepared to handle cases in which this value is `nil`.",
      "documentTitle": "extendedLanguageTag",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "이는 HTTP Live Streaming 재생 목록처럼 언어 정보가 선택적이거나, 기계 판독 가능한 형태로 언어 정보를 수용하지 않는 미디어 형식에서 발생할 수 있습니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:29.138Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
