      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Further, they should be prepared to handle cases in which an `extendedLanguageTag` is present but indicates that the language is “undetermined” (a language value of @“und”, as defined in ISO 639-2).",
